Cell["\<\
Uses HallAndLongitudinalResistances with the same lead ordering and options.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->440353208,ExpressionUUID->"a8bf4e03-f809-4d46-9118-94c1e13d5b38"],

Cell["\<\
For {RH, RL}, returns {-RH, RL}/(RH^2 + RL^2). No extra physical unit factor \
is applied.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->412407670,ExpressionUUID->"62b9c92a-2ef0-f44a-a494-3b3c1cec0771"],

Cell["\<\
The same LUDecomposition compatibility limitation as in \
HallAndLongitudinalResistances applies; zero or nonnumeric resistances cannot \
be converted meaningfully.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->209068862,ExpressionUUID->"9f52899b-fecd-f948-9570-7af4bda81196"]
}, Closed]],

